OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 JUN
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GMark Forrest with Dvorak, Mozart
OL,11,     G& Brahms from the Royal Liverpool
OL,12,     GPhilharmonic Orchestra, and we
OL,13,     Ghear Mahler lieder from baritone
OL,14,     GAndrew Hamilton and Haydn from
OL,15,     Gthe Chaos Quartet.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod explores how the
OL,18,     Glabel 'Anonymous' can be used to
OL,19,     Gbring together disparate creators
OL,20,     Gand give their works a shared
OL,21,     Gidentity. With Lisa Colton and
OL,22,     GFay Hield.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
