OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 JUN
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GFlautist Lisa Friend, pianist
OL,6,     GMark Kinkaid and cellist Martin
OL,7,     GRadford perform live. Pianist
OL,8,     GLucy Parham and actress Joanna
OL,9,     GDavid discuss the music of Clara
OL,10,     GSchumann.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,14,     Gfavourites, including music by
OL,15,     GGrieg, Liszt and Szymanowska.
OL,16,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,17,     GChief Conductor Domingo Hindoyan
OL,18,     Gjoins the Royal Liverpool
OL,19,     GPhilharmonic in a performance of
OL,20,     GMahler's Symphony No. 9.
