OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 JUN
OL,4,G2145FBetween the Ears: Miniatures
OL,5,     F(Midsummer Dreaming)
OL,6,     GIn Night Chorus, a night walk
OL,7,     Gthrough an Illinois marsh reveals
OL,8,     Gthe bigness of small things.
OL,9,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,10,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,11,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,12,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,13,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,14,     Geverything in between.
OL,15,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,16,     GSoweto is back with more of the
OL,17,     Gbest in jazz from the UK and
OL,18,     Garound the world, and Nduduzo
OL,19,     GMakhathini spotlights another
OL,20,     Galbum for his selection.
